  "bodyHash": "f89ff25ef8bc65f8",
  "content": "\n\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>建議單獨遊玩。</strong></span><br>深淵中存在著一個善變的夢魘：它擁有令人不安的智慧與多變的形態。在親眼目睹之前，你只能透過遠方的低語、短暫的陰影、細微的變化以及被窺視的壓迫感來察覺它的存在。<br><br><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>追逐（Chase）</strong></span> 與 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化（Decay）</span> </strong>是其中兩種可被消滅的形態。<br>然而，你必須找到並摧毀它們的<strong>心<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></strong>才能徹底消滅它們。<br><br>只要<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化</span></strong>在你的世界中存在，你就會持續遭受<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化詛咒</span> </strong>的折磨。<br><br>它不僅僅是追殺。<br>它還會操縱你的思緒。<br><br>你將成為下一個受害者，還是能倖存於它的遊戲之中？<br><br><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_bd9c9e4d-0db5-448d-bb92-5e6458141ea5.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"80\"><br><br><br></pre>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>動態遭遇</strong>：<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>蒙面者（Masked）的</strong></span>出現遵循不規則的模式與觸發條件。<br><br><strong>隨機AI</strong>：<strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">蒙面者（Masked）的</span></strong>行為每次都會有所不同，因為它是為混亂而生，旨在讓你始終保持緊張。<br><br><strong>沉浸體驗</strong>：氛圍營造、令人不安的事件以及音視覺干擾都是深度沉浸感的組成部分。<br><br><strong>多種形態</strong>：面對 <strong><span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">蒙面者（Masked）</span></strong> 的恐怖變體，例如 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化（Decay）</span></strong> 和 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">追逐（Chase）</span></strong>。<br><br><strong>心臟與弱點</strong>：你必須摧毀 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">追逐（Chase）</span></strong> 或 <strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">腐化（Decay）</span> <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></strong> 才能擊殺它們。<br><br><strong>屍體與血腥</strong>：遭遇結束後，現場會留下屍體、血液與<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"> <strong>心</strong></span><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></strong>，同時伴隨全新生成的結構，進一步提升恐怖氛圍。<br><br><strong>新事件與機制</strong>：創新的玩法轉折，讓你無法預測下一步。<br><br><strong>自訂體驗</strong>：搭配 <strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><a style=\"color:#95a5a6\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/configured\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Configured</a></span> </strong>模組調整生成機率、難度、行為模式與特殊事件。（數值越低代表出現頻率越高，數值越高則越稀有。）</pre>\n</div>\n<pre style=\"text-align:center\"><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_10001d9d-88b3-48ff-be67-cad1ef06d717.png\" width=\"247\" height=\"80\"><br><br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">屍體</span>清理器</strong><br><br>屍體不會自行消失；你可以將其清理以獲取肉塊，用於製作<strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心<span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></span> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">螢光指示器</span></strong>，或是任由恐懼留存現場。<br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_e7dc331a-83bb-4014-8037-7dfecbbe7769.png\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span><br><br>對著<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>懸掛的屍體</strong></span>或<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>倒地的屍體</strong></span>點擊右鍵即可清除。<br><br>使用一次後，清理器會變得髒污。<br><br>將其放入<strong><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">水</span></strong>中清洗即可重複使用。<br><br><strong><span style=\"color:#7e8c8d\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">臟</span></span>螢光指示器</strong><br><br>根據環境的不同，<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">紅心</span></strong>與<strong><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">灰心</span></strong>都難以尋找。借助此裝置，你可以辨識出需要摧毀的活體心臟。<br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>合成配方</strong></span><br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_1665cf33-c5bf-425e-99c7-800e0d519603.png\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><strong>使用方法</strong></span><br><br>手持<strong><span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><span style=\"color:#95a5a6\">心</span>臟</span>螢光指示器</strong>。<br><br>任何目前<strong>存活</strong>的<span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong>灰心</strong></span>或<span style=\"color:#ba372a\"><strong>紅心</strong></span>都會獲得<span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\"><strong>發光效果</strong></span>，從而更容易定位。<br><br>發光效果僅在你手持該裝置時生效。<br><br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_0095b49c-974b-49e9-b65d-4b552a5d3da6.png\" width=\"227\" height=\"74\"><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\">Upsidedowntree</span><em><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"> </span>- 美術／3D美術與動畫</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#236fa1\">VantablackDEV</span> - 測試員／協助開發</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#236fa1\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@Knvifrr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Knvif</a> <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- <span style=\"color:#95a5a6\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">蒙面者（Masked）的</span></strong> </span>配音靈感來源</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#843fa1\">Monty</span></span></span><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> - 動畫與程式編寫</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\">Brguiireal - 測試員／協助開發</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\">TournamenU</span> - 美術／3D美術</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#ba372a\">ClouddyVR</span><em> - 動畫</em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><span style=\"color:#e67e23\">Ebalia</span></span></span><em><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"> - 創意構想與程式編寫</span></span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#ced4d9\"><em>Nempth <span style=\"color:#ecf0f1\">- 創意構想與美術</span></em></span><br><br><span style=\"color:#4069c6\"><em><br></em><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1248540/description_4bed5646-5f75-4a00-9b7a-99f313ebc9eb.png\" width=\"148\" height=\"148\"></a></span></pre>",
